{"id":"604303","name":"无敌蛋炒饭","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/604303/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"1个"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱花。","img":"images/604303/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"火腿肠切片。","img":"images/604303/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋。","img":"images/604303/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜切丁。","img":"images/604303/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄瓜切丁。","img":"images/604303/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大米饭。","img":"images/604303/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"先把蛋黄与蛋清分离。","img":"images/604303/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蛋黄打散倒入米饭中。","img":"images/604303/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/604303/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"油热米饭下锅。","img":"images/604303/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"米饭炒散后依次放入火腿、胡萝卜、黄瓜。","img":"images/604303/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"随后放入盐、十三香、白胡椒。","img":"images/604303/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"炒拌均匀。","img":"images/604303/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入蛋清。","img":"images/604303/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"将蛋清炒至凝结成块。","img":"images/604303/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/604303/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"炒拌均匀后放入味精。","img":"images/604303/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"撒上葱花。","img":"images/604303/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"炒拌均匀即可出锅。","img":"images/604303/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"一道有灵魂的蛋炒饭就好了，完美！","img":"images/604303/step_20.jpg"}],"tips":"蛋黄拌进米饭时一定要搅拌均匀，蛋清炒凝结后再放入生抽。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}